TWO TRIBES. 

THE NEW PRESIDENT OF SYRIA HAS UNDERTAKEN HIS FIRST PROJECT 
AS RULER OF THAT STATE: THE INVASION OF TURKEY. 

TERRITORIAL BORDER CONFLICTS ERUPTED INTO A FULL SCALE DECLARATION
OF HOSTILITIES. OPERATING UNDER U.N. RESOLUTION 9378-438-C, UNITS
FROM THE MLF RAPID DEPLOYMENT ADVISORY GROUP HAVE BEEN DEPLOYED TO 
THE TURKISH FRONTIER.

1ST AND 2ND PLTS, ECHO CO OF THE 14TH CAV HAVE BEEN ISSUED ORDERS 
TO ENGAGE ENEMY TARGETS WITHIN THE ZONE DESIGNATED BRAVO SECTOR. 

ECHO-1 PLT MUST PROCEED ON A COURSE HEADING OF 125ø S/SE. UNIT 
OBJECTIVE WILL BE A SYRIAN FORWARD COMMUNICATIONS RELAY POST.

ECHO-1 HAS A COURSE HEADING OF 160ø S/SE. DESIGNATED OBJECTIVE IS 
SYRIAN FUEL REPLENISHMENT EMPLACEMENT. SECONDARY TARGETS WILL 
INCLUDE GROUND BASED ARTILLERY BATTERY.
